      <!-- Section: Our Lesson Rates -->
      <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading font-bold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">Our Lesson Rates</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">At Vibrations Violin Studio, lessons are designed around thoughtful, individualized learning rather than one-size-fits-all instruction.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Current lesson rates are:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 pl-5 list-disc text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">
        <li>30 minutes — $50</li>
        <li>45 minutes — $75</li>
        <li>60 minutes — $100</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Students may choose online or in-person lessons in central Denver, depending on availability and fit. <a href="/about#rates" class="text-purplePrimary underline hover:text-purple-800 transition-colors duration-150">See the full breakdown of lesson options</a> for details on trial lessons and policies.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Every new student begins with a free 15-minute discovery conversation, where we talk about goals, answer questions, and determine whether the studio is the right match. There's no pressure to enroll.</p>

      <!-- Section: Choosing the Right Teacher Is an Investment -->
      <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading font-bold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">Choosing the Right Teacher Is an Investment in the Learning Experience</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">The least expensive lesson isn't always the most affordable if it leads to frustration or quitting.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Likewise, the highest-priced teacher isn't automatically the best fit.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">The goal is to find a teacher who combines expertise with a learning environment where students feel comfortable asking questions, making mistakes, and growing over time.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Whether you're a parent exploring lessons for your child or an adult considering violin for the first time, finding the right teacher can make learning feel both challenging and encouraging.</p>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <h2 class="mt-12 font-heading font-bold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;">Are more expensive violin teachers always better?</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Not necessarily. Experience and training matter, but teaching style and student fit are just as important.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;">How often should beginners take lessons?</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Most beginners benefit from one lesson each week paired with consistent home practice.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;">Is 30 minutes enough?</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">For many beginners, yes. As students develop greater focus and more material to work on, longer lessons often become beneficial.</p>

      <h3 class="mt-8 font-heading font-semibold text-ink" style="font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.015em;">Are online violin lessons less expensive?</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">Sometimes, but not always. High-quality online lessons still provide personalized instruction and meaningful feedback.</p>

      <!-- Local SEO closing section -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-lavender-200">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold text-ink" style="font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">Ready to Explore Violin Lessons?</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">If you're looking for beginner-friendly violin lessons in Denver—or thoughtful online lessons from anywhere—I'd be happy to answer your questions during a free 15-minute discovery call.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary inline-block mt-8" aria-label="Get started with a free discovery call about violin lessons in Denver">
          Get Started
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>
  </article>

